NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v2 and v3

The Parakeet voice models in Useful Voice are NVIDIA's parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2 and
parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3 speech recognition models, converted to Core ML by FluidInference and
downloaded on request from Hugging Face:

  https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2
  https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3
  https://huggingface.co/FluidInference/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2-coreml
  https://huggingface.co/FluidInference/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3-coreml

